{
    "title": "Weather Forecast - Live Radar",
    "description": "Weather Forecast - Live Radar is the most accurate and best weather app near you!\r\n\r\nWeather Forecast - Live Radar providing you with detailed weather information around the world in a simple and clear way, including real-time dynamic radar, a variety of beautiful free weather widgets, 7*24 hours of accurate hourly forecasts for 7 days, long accurate daily forecast for 45 days, hurricane tracker, lighting tracker, timely weather reports like daily weather, weather tomorrow, storm alert, gale warning, severe weather warning and more. All kinds of weather details you may want to know include humidity, feel temperature, air pressure, wind speed, sunrise and sunset times, air pollution, pollen count and allergen concentration, and even you can find all kinds of advice of life about fishing, flight, clothing.\r\n\r\nWith all kinds of unusual and extreme weather such as heavy rains, droughts, floods, tornadoes, storms, quakes, blizzards and sudden temperature changes frequently appearing all over the world, you need the most accurate and real-time weather forecasting app to help you prepare for severe weather. Weather Forecast - Live Radar is your best choice.\r\n\r\n<b>What Can You Find in Weather Forecast - Live Radar?</b>\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 Hurricane Tracker.</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7 Earthquake early warning.</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7 Up to 14+ widgets in multiple formats.</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7 Detailed hourly forecasts up to 7 days.</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7 Daily detailed forecast for up to 45 days.</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7 Two-hour and minute-level rainfall forecast.</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7 Easy access to local weather conditions in cities around the world.</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7 Dynamic weather radar maps with various layers like rainfall, temperature, dew point, wind speed, UV index and more.</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7 Detailed weather info such as wind speed, atmospheric pressure, humidity, visibility, sunrise and sunset time, air quality such as PM10 and PM2.5, living index, allergy forecast, etc.</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0fLive dynamic radar\r\nLive Doppler radar maps, storm radar, severe weather alert, and accurate weather updates can warn you ahead of time of heavy rain, high wind, heat waves, or an incoming flood.\r\n\ud83c\udf2aHurricane Tracker\r\nSee upcoming hurricane paths and landfall times in real-time hurricane radar to prepare for storm and hurricane season.\r\n\u26a0\ufe0fEarthquake early alert\r\nSevere weather and geological disasters such as quakes have occurred frequently around the world, real-time weather updates can ensure your life safety and help you avoid losses caused by extreme weather.\r\n\ud83c\udf24Detailed hourly and daily weather forecast\r\nAccurate weather and detailed hourly and daily forecasts allow you to see long-term weather conditions up to 45 days in advance and plan for meetings, trips, flights and more.\r\n\ud83c\udf29Various weather widgets\r\nYou can find widgets with various layouts and UI to your satisfaction in Weather Forecast - Live Radar, and more widgets are in development, so stay tuned.\r\n\ud83c\udf282-hour minute-level Minutecast\r\nYou can use the Rain Tracker to easily see weather such as rainfall and snowfall every minute for the next two hours, as well as precipitation and snow thickness.\r\n\ud83c\udf27Global weather condition\r\nYou can check the local weather of friends and family in other towns anytime, anywhere, just add their cities. You can add any number of countries or cities like Texas, Las Vegas, New York, Florida, Houston and know their weather at the same time.\r\n\u2600\ufe0fDetailed weather information and custom units\r\nYou can find all kinds of weather information such as maximum and minimum temperature, air pollution, allergy forecast and more. And all of the units for weather details can be customized.\r\n\r\nDownload and try out the most accurate and best weather app out there!\r\nIf you have any questions or suggestions while using the weather app, please contact us at zapps-studio@outlook.com.",
